    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d359">

                <pb facs="0509" n="495" sameAs="frus:frus1945v09/pg495"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">862.20235/12–1945: Airgram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Argentina</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Cabot</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Buenos Aires</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1945-12-16">December 16,
                        1945</date>.<lb/>[Received December 29—11:17 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>A–689. Reference Department’s telegram no. 1585 of November 9, 12 noon<anchor
                        n="91" xml:id="d359-f1"/> concerning action taken in the cases of Sindreu,
                    Hellmuth, Liehr, Hoppe, Pigrau.</p>
                <p>Sindreu still has not arrived here. Pigrau was deported to Paraguay about month
                    ago; have thus far been unable obtain specific details. Asunción is now being
                    advised. Foreign Office believes that Hellmuth and Liehr cases have been
                    presented to court; prosecution is completely confidential.</p>
                <p>Unconfirmed report, however, indicates that Hellmuth released by court. This may
                    be simply release on bond pending trial. Hoppe case also expected to be taken to
                    court soon according to Foreign Office.</p>
                <p>Further information will be reported as it becomes available.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Cabot</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
